  "description": "After surviving one toxic ex too many, Seo Jae-Yi swears off men and moves into a quiet studio apartment for a fresh start. But her peaceful retreat instantly derails when an irritating parking dispute entangles her with her neighbor, Ji Hyeon-U. Bound by proximity and trapped in a sweltering apartment under a broken air conditioner, the two clash, sweat, and collide, turning a petty neighborly dispute into a high-heat physical affair. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Gotyugacheol Danpyeonseon (곧휴가철 단편선) Collection.*",
